**9.9.32**

\[\mbox{ber},x+i\,\mbox{bei},x= \sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{e^{(x+i\lambda)\pi i/\mu}xJ_{+ik}(x)}{2!^{k}\,k!}\] \[= \sum_{k=0}^{\infty}\frac{e^{(x+i\lambda 0\pi i/\mu}xI_{+jk}(x)}{2!^{k}\,k!}\] \[\mbox{ber}_{n}(x\sqrt{2})= \sum_{k=-\infty}^{\infty}(-)^{\ast+k}J_{+\pm 2k}(x)I_{\mp 2k}(x)\]

**9.9.33**

\[\mbox{bei}_{n}(x\sqrt{2})= \sum_{k=-\infty}^{\infty}(-)^{\ast+k}J_{+2k}(x)I_{\mp 2k}(x)\] \[\mbox{bei}_{n}(x\sqrt{2})= \sum_{k=-\infty}^{\infty}(-)^{\ast+k}J_{+2k+1}(x)I_{\mp 2k+1}(x)\]